 **Data Structures:**
-*   **1D Array:** A contiguous block of memory (e.g., `TArray`, `std::vector`, or raw pointer) of size $X' \cdot Y' \cdot Z'$, where $X'=X+P, Y'=Y+P, Z'=Z+P$ [S1, S3, unofficial].
