-    $$ I = (x + 1) \cdot ((Y + 1)(Z + 1)) + (y + 1) \cdot (Z + 1) + (z + 1) $$
-    This maps the logical grid $[0, X-1] \times [0, Y-1] \times [0, Z-1]$ to an internal buffer with a 1-voxel border [S3, unofficial].
